
This folder contains input file, grid file, mass matrix file, stiffness matrix file, shear stiffness matrix file
for the flexible barge case with the 4mm high steel plates in the Journal paper 

'Solving for hydroelastic ship response using Timoshenko beam modes at forward speed'

Note that please select the Timoshenko beam and Newman hydrostatic model, and let gamma_Timo = 0.005372616, inside the codes, 'OW3DConstants.cpp'.

